### Task Model

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots | Justification |
|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|---------------|
| **AT1: Navigate to Storage** | Robot navigates to the storage location to collect resources. | AND | *storage* | 1 | One robot must perform the navigation. |
| **AT2: Request Resource** | Robot sends a request to the storage with the precise specification of the requested resources. | AND | *storage* | 1 | Single robot handles the communication. |
| **AT3: Wait for Resource** | Robot waits until the resources have been retrieved from storage. | AND | *storage* | 1 | The robot must wait at the storage. |
| **AT4: Go Back to Recharge** | Robot returns to the charging station due to low battery during collection. | AND | *recharge station* | 1 | The robot must recharge. |
| **AT5: Assign Mission to Another Robot** | Robot assigns the remaining mission to another robot. | AND | *current location* | 1 | One robot assigns the task. |
| **AT6: Navigate to Delivery Location** | Robot navigates to the delivery location to deliver the resources. | AND | *delivery location* | 1 | The robot must navigate. |
| **AT7: Deliver Resource** | Robot delivers the resource to the requesting agent at the delivery location. | AND | *delivery location* | 1 | The robot performs the delivery. |
| **AT8: Return Resource to Checkpoint** | Robot returns the resource to a checkpoint due to low battery during delivery. | AND | *checkpoint* | 1 | The robot must return. |
| **AT9: Trigger Alert** | Robot triggers an alert due to failure to return resource to checkpoint. | AND | *current location* | 1 | The robot must alert. |
| **AT10: Send Report to Sector Manager** | Robot sends a report to the sector manager after triggering an alert. | AND | *sector manager* | 1 | The robot sends the report. |

